WEBVTT

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:01.492
It was 15 more hours,

00:10:01.516 --> 00:10:03.725
which for most swimmers
would be a long time.

00:10:03.749 --> 00:10:06.875
(Laughter)

00:10:06.899 --> 00:10:10.216
(Applause)

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:14.244
You have no idea how many
15-hour training swims I had done.

00:10:14.785 --> 00:10:18.602
So here we go, and I somehow,
without a decision,

00:10:18.626 --> 00:10:20.944
went into no counting of strokes

00:10:20.968 --> 00:10:22.277
and no singing

00:10:22.301 --> 00:10:27.492
and no quoting Stephen Hawking
on the parameters of the universe.

00:10:27.516 --> 00:10:33.743
I just went into thinking
about this dream, and why and how.